@base <https://ontoboard.org/patterns/pmdco-fundamental-property.owl> .

<https://ontoboard.org/patterns/pmdco-fundamental-property.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                 dcterms:description "Fundamental material properties are always present: density for portions of matter, mass and volume for objects. Fundamental object properties are extensive, scaling with the size of the object, and are given a value through a scalar value specification carrying a numeric value and a unit label."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                 dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
                                                                 dcterms:title "Fundamental property"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                 rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label moved to skos:prefLabel x3; label added x8; term declared x4;
- header: dcterms:title \"Fundamental property\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
- header: dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> - https://github.com/materialdigital/core-ontology
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en .

